{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17138","headline":"赠冯宿 · 李观","name":"赠冯宿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒城上秦原，游子衣飘飘。\n黑云截万里，猎火从中烧。\n阴空蒸长烟，杀气独不销。\n冰交石可裂，风疾山如摇。\n时无青松心，顾我独不凋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17138.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17138","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}